data: {"id": "71f9258d0a604652-thinking-parallel_evidence-1648", "run_id": "71f9258d0a604652", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "### 已采集事实汇总\n\n针对 `aiops-case-v08/workload` 的所有已执行工具结果如下：\n\n| 维度 | 关键事实 (Canonical Facts) | 证据来源 |\n|------|--------------------------|----------|\n| **生命周期/状态** | Pod 状态 `Running`，但容器状态 `CrashLoopBackOff`；重启 15 次；未 Ready。 | Metrics, Describe, YAML |\n| **退出原因** | Last State: Terminated, **Exit Code 127**, Reason: Error | Describe, YAML |\n| **崩溃前日志** | `sh: exec: line 0: /opt/app/unavailable-command: not found` | Previous Logs, ES Logs |\n| **K8s 事件** | `Back-off restarting failed container app` (持续 57", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789135210953, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

